## Sample data

All sample data is synthetic, generated by `scripts/make_samples.py`. It describes no real project, company or
person. Names such as "Sample Drywall Co" are placeholders.

## Third-party names

Specification section numbers in the samples are illustrative. CSI and MasterFormat are the property of their owners.

